LOCATION:Judy’s Beach Café\, 2188 Queen St. E.\, Toronto\, ON
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/29170418/personsday-copy.jpg
END:VEVENT
