SUMMARY:Toronto All-Star Big Band
DESCRIPTION:One of the most exciting bands around\, the Toronto All-Star Big Band revives the spirit\, style\, and sound of the 30s\, 40s\, and 50s — that golden age of the big bands. \nThis event is a fundraiser for St. Luke East York Anglican Church\, 904 Coxwell Avenue at Cosburn Avenue. \nTickets $20. Kids 12 and under free. Tickets at the door $25. \nFor tickets\, e-transfer to st.luke@ca.inter.net. \nLight refreshments will be sold. We are accessible and we have parking.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/toronto-all-star-big-band/
LOCATION:St. Luke’s Anglican Church\, 904 Coxwell Ave.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
