SUMMARY:Tropi-Canada Havana Nights
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Kingston Road Village Concert Series and Azucar Picante Entertainment. Dance Instruction at 6:30 pm\, Concert at 7:30 pm. Featuring Teria Morada\, DLM Groove Collective feat Adis Rodriguez\, and Havana Queen. All donations received during the event will go toward relief and community assistance efforts in Cuba\, helping families facing crisis situations. Tickets and info: www.kruc.ca/concert-series
